{"query":"Lodha Malabar Hills  official site amenities","follow_up_questions":null,"answer":null,"images":[],"results":[{"url":"https://propertycloud.in/properties/explore/lodha-malabar-south-mumbai","title":"Lodha Malabar South Mumbai | Book 4 & 5 BHK wirh Flexible ...","content":"Lodha Malabar Hills Prices & its details can be found in the price section & Lodha Vista Lodha Malabar Hills brochure can be downloaded from the link mentioned below. Project has been praised by the home buyers & Lodha Group review is 4 out of 5 from over all the clients who have visited the site.\n\nBook your dream home today & get the best offer, Enquiry us\n\nPrice Pricing\n\n| Type | Carpet Area | Price |\n --- \n| Investing In The Best Location |\n| 4 BHK | 3826 - 4037 sq.ft. | ₹ 53.56 Cr |\n| 5 BHK | 6271 - 6640 sq.ft. | ₹ 87.79 - 92.96 Cr |\n\n##### Payment Plan  Lodha Malabar South Mumbai Download\n\nAvatar\n\n  \n\n##### Download CostSheet  Lodha Malabar South Mumbai Download\n\n  \n  \n\nFloor Plans   \nSite & Floor Plan\n\nAvatar\n\n##### 4 BHK\n\nAvatar\n\n##### 5 BHK\n\n  \n  \n\nAmenities Amenities\n\n Library [...] Lodha Malabar Hills Project Connrctivity\n\n Shree Babulnath Mandir - 3 min\n Girgaon Chowpatty - 5 min\n Hanging Garden - 9 min\n Charni Road Railway Station - 7 min\n\nLodha Malabar Hills Project Carpet area\n\n4 & 5 BHK - 9500 sq.ft\n\nLodha Malabar Hills Project Specification\n\nThe positive reviews of Lodha Malabar Hills stem from its strategic location, spacious apartments, world-class amenities, and connectivity to important destinations.\n\nLodha Malabar Hills Mumbai stands out as a remarkable residential development that combines the tranquility of peaceful living with the ease of urban convenience.\n\n Lodha Malabar Hills Address: Lodha Malabar, Krishanaraj Society, Sea Face, Walkeshwar, Malabar Hill, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400006 [...] RERA No : PRM/KA/RERA/1251/446/PR/280222/004736  \n Disclaimer & Privacy Policy : The content is for information purposes only and does not constitute an offer to avail of any service. Prices mentioned are subject to change without notice and properties mentioned are subject to availability. Images for representation purpose only. This is not the official website. Website Only use for an Advertisement Purpose.\n\nOrganize Site Visit\n\nor Request a\n\n#### Pre-Register here for Best Offers\n\n##### For More Information :\n\n Call\n Lodha Malabar South Mumbai Enqiry Enquire \"Lodha Malabar South Mumbai Enqiry\")\n Whatsapp\n\nSimran Shah\n\nclose","score":0.9326037843122205,"raw_content":null,"id":"c5c8ff-00"},{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KDsBCAXdxd8","title":"Lodha Malabar Hills | South Mumbai | Sea View | Project Overview","content":"🟢 Key moments in this video 🟢\n0:00 Lodha Malabar Hills Intro\n0:25 Lodha Malabar Hills Overview \n1:20 Lodha Malabar Hills Amenities \n1:30 Lodha Malabar Hills Connectivity \n1:44 Lodha Malabar Hills Pricing And Configuration \n2:09 Booking Benefits \n2:15 Outro\n\n|| The Variants of Apartments at Lodha Malabar Hills ||\n\nLodha Malabar Hills Floor Plan\n\nFloor Plate with Carpet Area 9500 sq.ft. Pricing Start from ₹150 Cr Onwards \n\n|| Lodha Malabar Hills Project Specification ||\n\n🟢 Lodha Malabar Hills reviews are positive because of its strategic location, big spacious apartments, world class amenities and connectivity to key places.\n\n🟢 Lodha Malabar Hills price and other details you can download the brochure [...] 🛣️ Coastal Road - 8 min\n\nThis project is thoughtfully planned residences come with top-line specifications and superior craftsmanship, ensuring a refined living experience. Contact us today to schedule a site visit or to find out more about available homes and prices.  \n\nWhatsApp:  \n\nFacebook:   \n \nInstagram:    \n\nLinkedIn:   \n\n©️ PropertyCloud Realty Specifier Private Limited [...] Download E-Brochure:  \nDownload Price Sheet:  \n\nLodha Malabar Hills is a luxurious residential project developed by Lodha Group which is located in Malabar Hills, Mumbai. Lodha Malabar is an ultra-luxury residential development, rising 31 floors high, designed with exclusivity in mind by offering just one apartment per floor. Lodha Malabar Hills has uniquely designed floor plans and layouts to ensure ease and convenience for its residents. The property in Malabar Hills is located in a prime location and equipped with numerous amenities. Making it perfect for those who want a convenient and well-connected environment.","score":0.9190739982184319,"raw_content":null,"id":"051692-01"},{"url":"https://www.nobrokerage.com/project/details/lodha-malabar-walkeshwar-malabar-hill-mumbai-689041","title":"Lodha Malabar, Malabar hill, Mumbai | NoBrokerage.com","content":"Lodha Malabar is conveniently located near major transport hubs, ensuring seamless connectivity for daily travel.\n\nYou can view the exact map location of Lodha Malabar at available coordinates for better navigation and site visit planning.\n\nThe expected possession date of Lodha Malabar is expected by Jun 2027, as per the RERA filing.\n\nLodha Malabar falls under the STANDALONE housing segment, making it an ideal choice for homebuyers and investors.\n\nThe RERA registration number(s) for Lodha Malabar are P51900034949. You can verify these details on the official state RERA portal.\n\nThe total plot area of Lodha Malabar is 4390.96 SQM, thoughtfully planned for maximum green and recreational spaces. [...] 36\n\nAmenities\n\n#### Amenities\n\n33 Amenities\n\nParking\n\n#### Parking\n\nAvailable\n\nLocality\n\n#### Locality\n\nMalabar Hill\n\nPin code\n\n#### Pin Code\n\n400006\n\nLandmark\n\n#### Landmark\n\nMalabar Hill\n\nAddress\n\n#### Address\n\nLodha Malabar, Krishanaraj Society, Sea Face, Walkeshwar, Malabar Hill, Mumbai, Maharashtra\n\n## Configurations\n\n4 BHK3,826 - 4036.79 sq.ft\n\n₹ 65.05 – 68.63 Crore\n\n5 BHK6,271 - 6640.25 sq.ft\n\n₹ 106.61 – 112.88 Crore\n\nbackground pattern\n\nMumbai\n\n## Want to Schedule a Site Visit?\n\nExplore the property in person at your convenience.\n\nschedule illustration\n\n## FloorPlans\n\n4 BHK₹ 65.05 Cr\n\n3826 sq.ftCarpet Area\n\n4 BHK floor plan\n\nPossession  \nin Aug 2028\n\n### 4 BHK\n\n₹ 65.05 Cr\n\n3826sq.ft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n₹ 65.05 Cr\n\nPossession  \nin Aug 2028\n\n4 BHK₹ 68.63 Cr\n\n4036.79 sq.ftCarpet Area [...] Under Construction\n\nCompletion In 28 Jun 2027 Onwards\n\nLodha Malabar offers exclusive \"Palaces by the sea\" on Walkeshwar Road, an elite South Mumbai location. The project uniquely borders the Arabian Sea and the Hanging Gardens. Residents benefit from Club Saint Amand, a private members' club, and a life orchestrated by the luxury hospitality experts, Saint Amand. It offers large format 4 & 5 BHK, Duplex, and Penthouse options. The MahaRERA registration number is P51900034949.\n\n## ProjectDetails\n\nProject Type\n\n#### Project Type\n\nResidential\n\nStatus\n\n#### Status\n\nUnder Construction\n\nProject Area\n\n#### Project Area\n\n4390.96 SQM\n\nTowers\n\n#### Towers\n\n1\n\nConfigurations\n\n#### Configurations\n\n4 & 5 BHK Apartments\n\nTotal Floors\n\n#### Total Floors\n\n36\n\nAmenities\n\n#### Amenities\n\n33 Amenities","score":0.8960980363286638,"raw_content":null,"id":"08aefc-02"},{"url":"https://housing-is-01.s3.amazonaws.com/6a32315a/53baf705d7065fdb49c2228cbadf6635/original.pdf","title":"[PDF] Headquartered in London, Lodha Luxury represents the highest - AWS","content":"Altamount Road aka Billionaires’ Row, is home to a new landmark. Standing at the site of the former residence of the U.S. Consul General, Lodha Altamount is a vision in glass, shielding its influential residents from the public gaze, while allowing unrestricted views of the Arabian Sea. [...] • Spacious areas ideal for bedrooms with attached bathrooms.\n• A room that can be converted into a puja or storage room.\n• Separate room and bathroom for the staff.\n• Separate utility area.\nSERVICES FROM THE ROUTINE TO THE RARE.\nOFFERED BY THE INIMITABLE SAINT AMAND. Housekeeping carried out with the utmost care and discretion. A bespoke five-star dinner brought to your table at home. Impossibly hard to get tickets, acquired. Bonbons from faraway confectioners, procured. Whatever service you desire, it will be delivered with Saint Amand’s signature finesse. AMENITIES BY LONDON’S LEADING HOSPITALITY EXPERTS.\nHOW MANY CAN COME HOME TO THAT ? [...] Lodha Maison, Mumbai Lodha Ciel, Mumbai Lodha Maison, Mumbai Lodha Altamount, Mumbai No.1 Grosvenor Square, London STUNNING SEA VIEWS, A WORLD-CLASS LIFESTYLE, AND A PRESTIGIOUS ADDRESS.\nWHERE ELSE WILL YOU FIND IT ALL?\nDesigned by a team of international experts, Lodha Seamont is a sublime synthesis of modern luxury and international finesse. A rare find – even in a neighbourhood as coveted as Malabar Hill. At the most exclusive strip of Malabar Hill, where land meets sea, is Lodha Seamont: a grand tower overlooking Raj Bhavan. This development offers a limited selection of 3- and 4-bed residences, quite unlike any in the city. These homes afford stunning views of the Queen’s Necklace and the Arabian Sea, and offer world-class amenities that celebrate the Lodha lifestyle.","score":0.8514389292011492,"raw_content":null,"id":"068229-03"},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/lodha-malabar/208302/project","title":"Lodha Malabar, Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Price on Request","content":"### Nearby Landmarks\n\n|  |  |\n --- |\n| Landmark | Distance / Connectivity |\n| Hanging Gardens | 2.6 KM |\n| Governor's Estate | 1.9 KM |\n| Shree Babulnath Mandir | 1.4 KM |\n| Marine Drive | 0.5 KM |\n| Nariman Point | 5.4 KM |\n| CSMT Railway Station | 4.4 KM |\n\nLandmark\n\nDistance / Connectivity\n\nHanging Gardens\n\n2.6 KM\n\nGovernor's Estate\n\n1.9 KM\n\nShree Babulnath Mandir\n\n1.4 KM\n\nMarine Drive\n\n0.5 KM\n\nNariman Point\n\n5.4 KM\n\nCSMT Railway Station\n\n4.4 KM\n\nConnectivity is based on the official project information and location context.\n